## Interface: 120007
## Title: Midnight Helper
## Version: 2.10.0
## Author: TwelveInchy
## Category: User Interface
## Notes: All-in-one Midnight (12.0.7) helper: weekly planning, Delves, Great Vault, achievement hunts, a class keybind coach, combat helpers and route guidance.
## Notes-deDE: All-in-one-Helfer für Midnight (12.0.7): Wochenplanung, Delves, Great Vault, Erfolgsjagden, Tastenbelegungs-Coach, Kampfhilfen und Routenführung.
## Notes-frFR: Assistant tout-en-un pour Midnight (12.0.7) : planning hebdomadaire, Delves, Great Vault, hauts faits, coach de raccourcis, aides de combat et guidage d'itinéraire.
## Notes-esES: Ayudante todo en uno para Midnight (12.0.7): planificación semanal, Delves, Great Vault, logros, coach de atajos, ayudas de combate y guía de rutas.
## Notes-ptBR: Ajudante tudo-em-um para Midnight (12.0.7): planejamento semanal, Delves, Great Vault, conquistas, coach de atalhos, ajudas de combate e guia de rotas.
## Notes-itIT: Aiutante tutto-in-uno per Midnight (12.0.7): pianificazione settimanale, Delves, Great Vault, imprese, coach dei tasti, aiuti in combattimento e guida ai percorsi.
